    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d206">

                <pb facs="1255" n="1097" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1097"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Ambassador
                        Thompson</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-09-28"><hi rendition="#italic">September 28,
                            1906</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Referring to your telegram, 13th instant, case of the schooner <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Hatteras</hi>. Please forward to department copy of
                    paragraph 2, article 5, of Mexican law of December 18, 1902. If paragraph is not
                    too lengthy you may forward it by telegraph.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
